, "created": 1725013275, "last_modified": 1784247968, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "KingW777", "last_touched": 1787728650, "title": "咬牙下单了个茶，昨天晚上喝了一下真好喝啊，之前喝的都是啥玩意啊", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1237223", "created": 1787704768, "deleted": 0, "content": "价格 65 块 50g ，我之前都是和 65 150g 的，没想到提升一下预算差别这么明显\r\n茶叶 叶叶分明\r\n风味 跟说明的风味描述一直，荔枝风味很明显\r\n如果不是加了乱七八糟的调味，以后就加入口粮茶了\r\n\r\n在工位我喝猴王茉莉花茶量大管饱，家里用二才杯喝这个心情愉悦", "content_rendered": "<p>价格 65 块 50g ，我之前都是和 65 150g 的，没想到提升一下预算差别这么明显\n茶叶 叶叶分明\n风味 跟说明的风味描述一直，荔枝风味很明显\n如果不是加了乱七八糟的调味，以后就加入口粮茶了</p>\n<p>在工位我喝猴王茉莉花茶量大管饱，家里用二才杯喝这个心情愉悦</p>\n", "last_modified": 1787704768, "replies": 66, "id": 1237223}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 241077, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4510, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 610823, "username": "Hormazed", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/Hormazed", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b5ccfa4da65fe8088932ccdfc2ff74ac?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b5ccfa4da65fe8088932ccdfc2ff74ac?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b5ccfa4da65fe8088932ccdfc2ff74ac?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1674106916, "last_modified": 1674106916, "pro": 1787729690}, "last_reply_by": "Rickkkkkkk", "last_touched": 1787726489, "title": "请交有经验的朋友，都使用的哪些补气血方法", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1237226", "created": 1787705672, "deleted": 0, "content": "1.背景：从小体温偏低，36 度，所以日常容易出汗（一大烦恼）\n\n\n\n2.改进方法：\n\n有 4 年跑步习惯。可以跑进 5’30 ，心率偏高，提升空间有限（瓶颈在心肺），研究了一圈身体短板，觉得是气血不足。\n\n\n\n3.身体情况：\n\n健康，无病，怀疑出汗过多是代偿措施。以前有头晕情况，因跑步已有改善。\n\n\n\n4.问题：\n\n请交有经验的朋友分享补气血心得。", "content_rendered": "<p>1.背景：从小体温偏低，36 度，所以日常容易出汗（一大烦恼）</p>\n<p>2.改进方法：</p>\n<p>有 4 年跑步习惯。可以跑进 5’30 ，心率偏高，提升空间有限（瓶颈在心肺），研究了一圈身体短板，觉得是气血不足。</p>\n<p>3.身体情况：</p>\n<p>健康，无病，怀疑出汗过多是代偿措施。以前有头晕情况，因跑步已有改善。</p>\n<p>4.问题：</p>\n<p>请交有经验的朋友分享补气血心得。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1787705672, "replies": 63, "id": 1237226}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 11572, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2453, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 698558, "username": "Bullish", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/Bullish", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_mini.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_normal.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_large.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_xlarge.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_xxlarge.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_xxxlarge.png?m=1760142421", "created": 1719575876, "last_modified": 1760142421, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "undefine2020", "last_touched": 1787727081, "title": "最近老刷到男性觉醒的视频", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1237221", "created": 1787704514, "deleted": 0, "content": "总感觉是男性觉醒和女性觉醒会搞流量的在网络上输出，然后生活中的傻子全盘接受他们的理论在线下对线。\r\n\r\n视频切片都刷到吐了，这些应用厂商